<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
    <!-- ═══ MONOLITH THEME ═══

         A preset is a seed now, not a dictionary. The colours come from Shared/FallbackPalette.axaml
         until ThemeService.ApplyCustomization lands, and from the M3 generator after that; this
         preset's seed (#0A84FF) lives in Models/SeedPreset.cs (RemEx-2gjwn).

         THIS FILE IS A PURE MERGE NOW (RemEx-bnz2x). The heavy 3px border was the whole identity of
         this preset - the only one that is not glass, the only one whose cards are drawn rather than
         floated - and the ONE geometry key that survived ThemeService overwriting everything else.
         It now lives as SeedPresetCatalog's Monolith entry (CardBorderThickness: 3), written into
         CustomizationSettings.CardBorderThickness by SelectTheme the same way CornerRadius already
         is. One surviving key did not justify four dictionary files, so nothing preset-specific is
         declared here any more. The file still exists as the base-theme resource
         AppTheme.Monolith resolves to (ThemeService.BaseThemeUri / SwapBaseTheme) - that selection
         mechanism is unrelated to this bead and untouched by it.
    -->
    <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
        <ResourceInclude Source="avares://Remex.Desktop/Themes/Shared/FallbackPalette.axaml"/>
    </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
</ResourceDictionary>
